# Pinned claude-utils (claude-memsync) release used by install.sh: v0.3.0-ev.1, a pre-release
# of the fork MEMSYNC_URL names. Assets: claude-utils-<tag>-<os>-<arch>.tar.gz, hashes in
# SHA256SUMS. Pin a hash only after downloading the published archive and hashing it yourself.
